<title>USA: Thomas &amp; Betts Corp Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Thomas &amp; Betts Corp Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call mean estimate for Q4 was $0.68 per share</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.57   profit	 $0.26</p>
<p> Net loss		  30,799   profit	13,822</p>
<p> Sales		    501,586		  439,434</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  53,268		   52,684</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $1.13   profit	 $1.69</p>
<p> Net profit		59,868   profit	88,502</p>
<p> Sales		  1,985,145		1,733,368</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  53,059		   52,494</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q4 1996 oper shr was $0.66 vs $0.55 in Q4 1995</p>
<p>Q4 1996 net shr includes merger expenses of $30.56 million.</p>
<p>1995 amounts were restated to include December 1996 merger with Augat Inc.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
